## Kernel handbook — guidance, never authority

These chapters are guidance for the files in scope. Only the kernel
enforces; no chapter can widen, narrow or replace a gate, claim,
verdict or journal rule.

### Chapter project:legacy/*.m
(layer=project pattern=legacy/*.m merged=no sniffed=no)

PROJECT legacy guidance: do not modernise blind.

### Chapter project:src/**
(layer=project pattern=src/** merged=no sniffed=no)

PROJECT src guidance: keep modules pure.

### Chapter system:**/*.m
(layer=system pattern=**/*.m merged=no sniffed=yes)

SYSTEM objc-flavoured guidance.

### Resolution table

- <REL-PATH> → unmatched
- <REL-PATH> → unmatched
- <REL-PATH> → project:legacy/*.m
- <REL-PATH> → project:src/**
- <REL-PATH> → system:**/*.m
